  "goodToKnow": "Beherbergen means to house or accommodate: Gäste beherbergen, and of buildings, to contain: Das Schloss beherbergt eine Bibliothek. Die Herberge is an inn or hostel; the first Jugendherberge (youth hostel) in the world opened in 1912 in Altena Castle, Germany, founded by teacher Richard Schirrmann. Das Beherbergungsverbot made news in 2020 during Covid. Not separable: hat beherbergt."
